# What the image build never needs. The Dockerfile copies only package
# manifests, tsconfig.base.json, shared/, server/, web/package.json and
# cli/package.json.
#
# Compiled output and build state are left out so the build always compiles
# from source: a stale tsconfig.tsbuildinfo would let `tsc -b` skip emitting.
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/*.tsbuildinfo
**/coverage

# Secrets and the local database
.env
.env.*
infrastructure/.env
data

# Not part of the image
.git
corpus
docs
scripts
web/src
web/vendor
cli/src
cli/test
